<title>PHILIPPINES: Metrobank sees 1997 net at 6.65 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Metrobank sees 1997 net at 6.65 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Bank &amp; Trust Co said on Tuesday it sees its net income for 1997 reaching 6.65 billion pesos, 32.92 percent higher than the 5.003 billion pesos profits made last year.  </p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Tuesday, the bank said total interest income for this year was expected to be 26.202 billion pesos.</p>
<p>Last year Metrobank said its total interest income was 15.363 billion pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
